<p>The map in the sample comes pre-populated with a set of bookmarks. To ac=
cess a bookmark and move to that location, click on a bookmark's name from =
the list. To add a bookmark, pan and/or zoom to a new location and click on=
 the '+' in the bottom corner. Enter a unique name for the bookmark and cli=
ck ok, and the bookmark will be added to the list</p>
