<ul>
<li>Create a new <code>Bookmark</code> object passing in text (the name of =
the bookmark) and a <code>Viewpoint</code> as parameters.</li>
<li>Add the new bookmark to the book mark list with <code>BookmarkListModel=
::append(bookmark)</code>.</li>
</ul>
</li>
